  "notes": "Merges hardcore punk and heavy metal with trap. The parameter is register allocation: the **808 is saturated and SHORT so the guitars own the low-mids**, in unison with the riff root — the opposite of Lil Peep, where the 808 sustains under the guitar. Drop-tuned minor/Phrygian power-chord riffs are the entire melodic layer, doubled and panned wide, with no keys and no pad, and the kick is doubled with a metal kick sample against 808 clap. ⚠ `medium`: the style is directly sourced; no interview establishes tempo, so those parameters are inferred.",
